    "description": "We at My Home Group Asia Pacific Associates are looking for an experienced Real Estate Agent based out of Bengaluru. If you are a result-oriented professional with a passion for excellence, we want to hear from you.\n\nAbout My Home Group Asia Pacific Associates:\nMy Home Group Asia Pacific Associates is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Liaise with banks and NBFCs for home loan assistance to customers\n• Build relationships with channel partners and brokers\n• Conduct land acquisition due diligence and feasibility studies\n• Coordinate with architects, contractors, and project teams\n• Conduct market research and provide competitive analysis\n• Maintain a pipeline of qualified leads using CRM software\n• Manage relationships with existing customers post-purchase\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Ed / M.Ed from a recognized institution\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Due Diligence\n• Proficiency in Client Relationship Management\n• Proficiency in Project Management\n• Proficiency in GIS Tools\n• Proficiency in Property Valuation\n• Proficiency in Title Search\n• Proficiency in Real Estate Law\n• Proficiency in Contract Management\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Bengaluru, Karnataka, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with My Home Group Asia Pacific Associates!",
